        "text": "### Candidate [0]: Fable 5.1 Solves the Cyphral Distich\n* **Publisher:** vals.ai  \n* **Editorial Scope:** IN SCOPE  \n* **What is confirmed:** AI evaluation firm Vals AI published a blog post claiming that Anthropic's Claude Fable 5.1 model decrypted Sir Thomas Urquhart’s 1653 370-year-old \"Cyphral Distich\" cryptogram in 44 minutes"
